A/B autoboot (mt7986 / R3): fast boot + space-to-stop instead of the 30s menu.

Mirror of bpi-r4 z01 for R3's three media defconfigs (emmc/sd/snand): BOOTDELAY
30 -> 1 and AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW -> AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR (space). z02 (bootcount)
builds on the AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR line this adds.

--- a/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-emmc_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-emmc_defconfig
@@ -21,5 +21,5 @@
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=30
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
 CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_OF_SYSTEM_SETUP=y
--- a/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-sd_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-sd_defconfig
@@ -21,5 +21,5 @@
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=30
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
 CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_OF_SYSTEM_SETUP=y
--- a/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-snand_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-snand_defconfig
@@ -18,5 +18,5 @@
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=30
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
 CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
